WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Do not train reading and listening on the same day; split skill days.. Plan your

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
route and test centre in advance.. Protect your sleep; sleep consolidates

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
memory.. Avoid heavy food on exam day; eat light and familiar.. Prepare your ID

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
and confirmation number in advance.. Watch the screen clock, not the door.. If

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
the first question feels hard, scan for easier ones.. Know whether you may edit

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
answers after each section.. On computer-based tests there is no spell-check:

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
type carefully.. During breaks drink water and close your eyes for thirty

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.500
seconds..
